- branch(b1, XOR), guard(b1, n4, ...), guard(b1, n5, ...): The source describes a linear sequence ("check if the user has already liked the company and save the action. Finally, redirect...") with no conditional divergence based on the check result. The model hallucinates an exclusive choice split and edge guards not supported by the text.
